{"synopsis":"Joo Seungho tidak dapat melakukan virtual reality karena congenital hyperimmersion syndrome sebuah fenomena amplifikasi sensorik yang berlebihan Suatu hari serangkaian warna yang tidak diketahui turun kepadanya Ini adalah penguji perangkat VRS generasi ke4 Ketika saya bisa melakukan virtual reality melalui penguji saya pikir untuk pertama kalinya Yang dia tangkap adalah tali tembaga yang terbuat dari emas Ketika saya mengalami Lost Sky Online yang biasa disebut generasi keempat saya menyadarinya Sindrom hyperimmersion bawaan adalah racun di masa lalu tetapi sebenarnya itu adalah berkah","alternative_title":"70億分の1のイレギュラー","author":"LuckyNine, Randel","artist":"Goojaro","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"a6b0bd47-f590-46ed-9b2d-369653e2e0e9","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"Chapter 103","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"761237c6-5271-4805-9ae9-5f15b5703a03","number":"102","chapter":"102","title":"Chapter 102","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"57812f56-2696-477f-aa41-f46a7875b2cf","number":"101","chapter":"101","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a06a9ade-937f-4cf4-9550-fb7ede8b0b34","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"96dcf4e5-846c-461b-8733-50473cf6e800","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"705e9a14-8743-4fc8-a298-46405d1801f1","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9e011ee9-8cb3-4f78-88e1-f32fa3d05dab","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"907bec85-a139-4c76-9d96-c82a6363676b","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"cha